  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for Supporting Green Circular Economy through Agricultural Value Chain Improvement in Mekond Delta, Viet Nam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of strategic crop-based value chains(Development of integrated value chain enhancement strategies by crop, Improvement of road infrastructure supporting the value chain, Expansion of agricultural financial support), Capacity building for strategic crop value chains(Selection of appropriate quality inputs for each crop, Enhancement of production and processing technologies, Strengthening of distribution and marketing capabilities), Advancement of the green circular economy</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase farmers&apos; income and revitalize the green circular local economy in the Mekong Delta region of southern Vietnam by enhancing strategic crop value chains.&#xbca0;&#xd2b8;&#xb0a8; &#xb0a8;&#xbd80; &#xba54;&#xcf69;&#xb378;&#xd0c0; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xc758; &#xac00;&#xce58;&#xc0ac;&#xc2ac; &#xac1c;&#xc120;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed; &#xb18d;&#xbbfc; &#xc18c;&#xb4dd;&#xc99d;&#xb300; &#xbc0f; &#xb179;&#xc0c9; &#xc21c;&#xd658; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xacbd;&#xc81c; &#xd65c;&#xc131;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
